# 1.2.intake.structure.stone

## .what

structure the captured history into a clean timeline + entity set: the exposures (what was done to
the patient), the effects (what the patient shows), and the temporal order that links them.

## .inputs

- `1.1.intake.capture.yield.md` — the verbatim history

## .do

- lay out a timeline: each event with its timestamp (or relative time)
- itemize the **exposures** (per `define.causal-chain-frame` — the cause:exposure nodes)
- itemize the **effects** (the effect:symptom nodes)
- note dose/quantity/route for each exposure where stated

## .emit

into `1.2.intake.structure.yield.md`.

## .done when

a timeline + an itemized exposure set + an itemized effect set are laid out, linked in temporal order.
